Error [E0121]: `b` was consumed by `Box.unwrap`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/take_self_method.jet:10:13
    |
 10 |     print(b.n)
    |             ^
  --> tests/ui/take_self_method.jet:9:12
    |
  9 |     print(^b.unwrap())
    |            ^ `b` moved to `Box.unwrap` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `b` after the move, or give `Box.unwrap` a copy with `b.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
